<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ain't No Back To A Merry-Go-Round</title>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .poster-container {
    width: 600px;
    height: 900px;
    position: relative;
    background-color: #2a4b3c;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .placeholder {
    border: 1px dashed #ffffff;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 10px;
  }
  .bg-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .content-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 30px 25px 20px 25px;
  }
  .top-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .top-text strong {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .middle-section {
    margin-top: 360px;
  }
  .voices-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .voice-name {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .voice-and {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .tagline {
    margin-top: 50px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .title {
    font-family: 'Impact', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
    font-size: 54px;
    line-height: 0.9;
    margin: 10px 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .bottom-section {
    margin-top: auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }
  .logo-placeholder {
    width: 65px;
    height: 65px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  .credits-container {
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin: 0 15px;
  }
  .quote {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .quote-author {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .credits-block {
    font-size: 9.5px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .credits-block span {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="poster-container">
  <div class="bg-placeholder placeholder">
    [Photo: Young girl in blue dress looking out train window at a carousel building]
  </div>

  <div class="content-overlay">
    <div class="top-text">
      A FILM BY EMMY AWARD-WINNING DIRECTOR <strong>ILANA TRACHTMAN</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="middle-section">
      <div class="voices-label">FEATURING THE VOICES OF</div>
      <div class="voice-name">JEFFREY WRIGHT</div>
      <div class="voice-and">AND</div>
      <div class="voice-name">MANDY PATINKIN</div>
    </div>

    <div class="tagline">
      Before the March on Washington, there was Glen Echo.
    </div>

    <div class="title">
      AIN'T NO BACK<br>TO A MERRY-GO-ROUND
    </div>

    <div class="subtitle">
      AN UNTOLD CIVIL RIGHTS STORY.
    </div>

    <div class="bottom-section">
      <div class="logo-placeholder placeholder">[Logo: 25th Anniversary]</div>

      <div class="credits-container">
        <div class="quote">
          "a landmark achievement" <span class="quote-author">- Rep. Jamie Raskin, MD</span>
        </div>

        <div class="credits-block">
          RUBY PICTURES INC PRESENTS A FILM BY <span>ILANA TRACHTMAN</span><br>
          EXECUTIVE PRODUCERS <span>BARBARA DOBKIN, PAMELA MURPHY, RICK D'AVINO, JEFFREY Z. SLAVIN</span><br>
          ORIGINAL SCORE <span>ADAM DORN</span> EDITORS <span>SANDRA CHRISTIE, ACE, ANN COLLINS</span><br>
          MOTION GRAPHICS BY <span>TRAVIS HATFIELD/ FLASH CUTS</span><br>
          FEATURING THE VOICES OF <span>JEFFREY WRIGHT, MANDY PATINKIN, BOB BALABAN, PETER GALLAGHER,</span><br>
          <span>ALEX JOSEPH GRAYSON, ALYSIA REINER, TRACIE THOMS, DOMINIQUE THORNE</span> AND <span>LEE GRANT</span><br>
          PRODUCED AND DIRECTED BY <span>ILANA TRACHTMAN</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="logo-placeholder placeholder">[Logo: Official Selection]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
